---
// Services section component - Software Engineering Services
---

<section id="servicios" class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
            <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold tracking-wider uppercase mb-2 block">Soluciones de Software</span>
            <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-navy-900 mb-4">
                Servicios de Desarrollo de Software
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600">
                Construimos plataformas digitales robustas guiadas por metodologías de ingeniería de software moderna.
            </p>
            <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-emerald-500 mx-auto mt-6 rounded"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
            <!-- Service 1 -->
            <div
                class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border-t-4 border-emerald-500 group"
            >
                <div
                    class="w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-emerald-600 transition-colors"
                >
                    <i
                        class="fa-solid fa-laptop-code text-3xl text-emerald-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors"
                    ></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy-900 mb-3">
                    Desarrollo Web & Mobile Custom
                </h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    Desarrollo frontend y backend a medida con React, Astro, Node.js y apps móviles multiplataforma en React Native y Flutter.
                </p>
                <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-2">
                    <li>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-500 mr-2"
                        ></i>Aplicaciones SaaS & Web Platforms
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-500 mr-2"
                        ></i>Apps Móviles iOS & Android
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-500 mr-2"
                        ></i>APIs RESTful & GraphQL High Speed
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Service 2 -->
            <div
                class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border-t-4 border-navy-800 group"
            >
                <div
                    class="w-16 h-16 bg-navy-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-navy-800 transition-colors"
                >
                    <i
                        class="fa-solid fa-server text-3xl text-navy-800 group-hover:text-white transition-colors"
                    ></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy-900 mb-3">
                    Arquitectura Cloud & DevOps
                </h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    Diseño de arquitecturas escalables, infraestructura cloud en AWS/Vercel, contenedores Docker y orquestación CI/CD.
                </p>
                <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-2">
                    <li>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-500 mr-2"
                        ></i>Contenedores Docker & Kubernetes
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-500 mr-2"
                        ></i>Pipelines CI/CD Automatizados
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-500 mr-2"
                        ></i>Bases de Datos PostgreSQL & Redis
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Service 3 -->
            <div
                class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border-t-4 border-emerald-500 group"
            >
                <div
                    class="w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-emerald-600 transition-colors"
                >
                    <i
                        class="fa-solid fa-bug-slash text-3xl text-emerald-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors"
                    ></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy-900 mb-3">
                    Consultoría Ágil & QA Testing
                </h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    Auditoría de código legacy, implementación de metodologías ágiles (Scrum/Kanban) y pruebas automatizadas E2E.
                </p>
                <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-2">
                    <li>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-500 mr-2"
                        ></i>Pruebas Unitarias & Integración QA
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-500 mr-2"
                        ></i>Auditoría de Seguridad & Pentesting
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-500 mr-2"
                        ></i>Refactorización a Clean Code
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
